Database Template

Clone this file into.env and write in your credentials.

DBURL=jdbc:mysql://localhost:3306/librarymanagement
DBUSERNAME=yourusernamehere
DBPASSWORD=yourpasswordhere

In the case of other forms of databases:
DBURL=jdbc:mysql://localhost:3306/yourdatabasename
DBURL=jdbc:postgresql://localhost:5432/yourdatabasename
DB_URL=jdbc:sqlite:library.db
